---
<Layout title="Quotex vs Binomo vs Olymp Trade vs Pocket Option vs IQ Option 2026" description="Complete comparison of Quotex vs Binomo, Olymp Trade, Pocket Option and IQ Option. Which binary options platform is best in 2026? Payouts, features, deposits and bot support compared." keywords="quotex vs binomo, quotex vs olymp trade, quotex vs pocket option, quotex vs iq option, olymp trade vs quotex, binomo vs quotex, pocket option vs quotex, best binary options platform 2026, quotex comparison" schema={schema}>
  <Header/>
  <article class="blog-art">
    <div class="container blog-wrap">
      <header class="art-hdr">
        <div class="art-meta"><span class="badge badge-blue">Comparison</span><span class="art-date">July 2, 2026 · 8 min read</span></div>
        <h1>Quotex vs Binomo vs Olymp Trade vs Pocket Option vs IQ Option 2026</h1>
        <p class="art-lead">Choosing the right binary options platform matters. This detailed comparison covers Quotex against all major competitors — payouts, minimum deposits, demo accounts, bot support and which platform gives you the best trading experience in 2026.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="art-body">
        <h2>Quick Comparison Table</h2>
