          <div class="ct-row"><span>Bot Support</span><span class="green">✅ Yes</span><span>Limited</span><span>Limited</span><span>Limited</span><span>Limited</span></div>
          <div class="ct-row"><span>OTC Pairs</span><span class="green">✅ 24/7</span><span>✅ Yes</span><span>❌ No</span><span>✅ Yes</span><span>❌ No</span></div>
