        </div>
        <h2>Quotex vs Binomo</h2>
        <p>Both platforms offer binary options with similar minimum deposits ($10) and demo accounts. Quotex edges ahead with higher maximum payouts (95% vs 90%) and full Chrome extension bot support via Quotex Bot.</p>
        <p><strong>Winner: Quotex</strong> — Higher payouts and better automation support.</p>
