        <p><strong>Winner: Quotex</strong> — OTC pairs and 24/7 availability are essential for bot trading.</p>
        <h2>Quotex vs Pocket Option</h2>
        <p>Pocket Option has a higher minimum deposit ($50 vs $10) and slightly lower payouts. Both offer OTC pairs. Quotex Bot is specifically built for Quotex/QXBroker, giving Quotex a major advantage for automated traders.</p>
        <p><strong>Winner: Quotex</strong> — Lower entry barrier and dedicated bot support.</p>
        <h2>Quotex vs IQ Option</h2>
        <p>IQ Option is one of the most regulated binary options brokers but has been withdrawing from many markets. Quotex is more accessible globally and offers higher payouts. For traders in Asia, Africa and South America, Quotex is typically the better option.</p>
